// THE D0 DOOR AS A MODE (gunbc.spark.pair_serving_d0_door pair_serving_d0_ci_wet): on the broker
// host, files the consent under the named escalation, waits for the operator, and runs the Cut D
// D0 transaction over the named group under the admitted grant. It consumes the fleet ssh key
// because the transaction's observation reads the group's hosts over ssh. The consent is an
// operator-supplied input reused on every rerun (see the door), so nothing here derives it.
